IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `ei7-related-nouns`
IMPORT `ei7-related-2020-2023`

-- Tests of ei7-related-2020-2023. Every expected value is written by hand from the text of the related provision named
-- above it (src:3888-3999); none is copied from the encoding's output. Days that an amending Act leaves to "the day fixed
-- under section 61" or "the day on which ... come into force" are not in the deposited text, so the days used for them are
-- chosen to test the boundary and are not the real days.

§ `2020, c. 5, s. 60`

-- the day fixed under section 61 is taken as September 27, 2020.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2020 c. 5 s. 60 section 58 as it read immediately before the day fixed under section 61 continues to apply in respect of the claimant` (YMD 2020 9 26) (YMD 2020 9 27)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2020 c. 5 s. 60 section 58 as it read immediately before the day fixed under section 61 continues to apply in respect of the claimant` (YMD 2020 9 27) (YMD 2020 9 27))

§ `Interim Orders - applies despite`

#ASSERT `Act RP SOR/2020-61 s. 2 the provisions of Part VIII.4 apply despite the other provision` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Act RP SOR/2020-61 s. 2 the provisions of Part VIII.4 apply despite the other provision` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Act RP nine Interim Orders of 2020 the Interim Order applies despite the other provision` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Act RP nine Interim Orders of 2020 the Interim Order applies despite the other provision` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Act RP nine Interim Orders of 2020 the Interim Order applies despite the other provision` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `The bands of the day a benefit period begins`

#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 ss. 332 to 335 and 2022 c. 10 s. 411 the band of the day a benefit period begins` (YMD 2020 9 26) EQUALS `ei7 begins before September 27, 2020`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 ss. 332 to 335 and 2022 c. 10 s. 411 the band of the day a benefit period begins` (YMD 2020 9 27) EQUALS `ei7 begins from September 27, 2020 to September 25, 2021`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 ss. 332 to 335 and 2022 c. 10 s. 411 the band of the day a benefit period begins` (YMD 2021 9 25) EQUALS `ei7 begins from September 27, 2020 to September 25, 2021`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 ss. 332 to 335 and 2022 c. 10 s. 411 the band of the day a benefit period begins` (YMD 2021 9 26) EQUALS `ei7 begins from September 26, 2021 to September 24, 2022`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 ss. 332 to 335 and 2022 c. 10 s. 411 the band of the day a benefit period begins` (YMD 2022 9 24) EQUALS `ei7 begins from September 26, 2021 to September 24, 2022`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 ss. 332 to 335 and 2022 c. 10 s. 411 the band of the day a benefit period begins` (YMD 2022 9 25) EQUALS `ei7 begins on or after September 25, 2022`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 ss. 332 to 335 and 2022 c. 10 s. 411 the band of the day a benefit period begins` (YMD 2019 1 1) EQUALS `ei7 begins before September 27, 2020`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 ss. 332 to 335 and 2022 c. 10 s. 411 the band of the day a benefit period begins` (YMD 2026 10 1) EQUALS `ei7 begins on or after September 25, 2022`

§ `2021, c. 23, s. 332`

-- "begins before that day": September 25, 2021 is before September 26, 2021; September 26 is not.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 332 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2021 9 25)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 332 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2019 3 3)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 332 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2021 9 26))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 332 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (YMD 2021 9 25) EQUALS LIST `ei7 s 6(1) the definitions major attachment claimant and minor attachment claimant`, `ei7 s 7(2)`, `ei7 s 7.1(1)`, `ei7 s 12(8)`, `ei7 s 21(1)`, `ei7 ss 22(1), (2) and (5)`, `ei7 ss 23(1), (1.3), (4), (4.1), (5) and (6)`, `ei7 s 23.1(2)`, `ei7 s 23.2(1)`, `ei7 s 23.3(1)`, `ei7 s 28(7)`, `ei7 s 29(a)`, `ei7 ss 30(1) and (4) to (7)`, `ei7 s 51`, `ei7 Schedule I`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 332 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (YMD 2021 9 26) EQUALS EMPTY
-- fifteen paragraphs, (a) to (o).
#ASSERT count (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 332 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (YMD 2020 1 1)) EQUALS 15

§ `2021, c. 23, s. 333`

#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 333 Part VIII.5 as it read immediately before September 26, 2021 continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2020 9 26))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 333 Part VIII.5 as it read immediately before September 26, 2021 continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2020 9 27)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 333 Part VIII.5 as it read immediately before September 26, 2021 continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2021 9 25)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 333 Part VIII.5 as it read immediately before September 26, 2021 continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2021 9 26))

§ `2021, c. 23, s. 334`

#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 334(1) the operation of Part VIII.1 and its regulations is suspended on the day` (YMD 2021 9 25))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 334(1) the operation of Part VIII.1 and its regulations is suspended on the day` (YMD 2021 9 26)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 334(1) the operation of Part VIII.1 and its regulations is suspended on the day` (YMD 2022 9 24)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 334(1) the operation of Part VIII.1 and its regulations is suspended on the day` (YMD 2022 9 25))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 334(2) the operation of Part VIII.1 and its regulations continues to be suspended in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2021 9 25))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 334(2) the operation of Part VIII.1 and its regulations continues to be suspended in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2021 9 26)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 334(2) the operation of Part VIII.1 and its regulations continues to be suspended in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2022 9 24)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 334(2) the operation of Part VIII.1 and its regulations continues to be suspended in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2022 9 25))

§ `2021, c. 23, s. 335`

#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 335 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2021 9 25))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 335 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2021 9 26)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 335 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2022 9 24)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 335 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2022 9 25))
-- s. 335 lists whole sections 6(1), 21, 28 and 30 where s. 332 lists parts of them.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 335 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (YMD 2022 1 1) EQUALS LIST `ei7 s 6(1)`, `ei7 s 7(2)`, `ei7 s 7.1(1)`, `ei7 s 12(8)`, `ei7 s 21`, `ei7 ss 22(1), (2) and (5)`, `ei7 ss 23(1), (1.3), (4), (4.1), (5) and (6)`, `ei7 s 23.1(2)`, `ei7 s 23.2(1)`, `ei7 s 23.3(1)`, `ei7 s 28`, `ei7 s 29(a)`, `ei7 s 30`, `ei7 s 51`, `ei7 Schedule I`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 335 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (YMD 2022 9 25) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT count (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 335 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (YMD 2022 1 1)) EQUALS 15

§ `2021, c. 23, s. 336`

-- the day on which subsection 307(2) and section 323 come into force is taken as January 2, 2022.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 336 paragraphs 12(3)(c) and 152.14(1)(c) as amended apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2022 1 2) (YMD 2022 1 2)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2021 c. 23 s. 336 paragraphs 12(3)(c) and 152.14(1)(c) as amended apply in respect of the benefit period` (YMD 2022 1 1) (YMD 2022 1 2))

